# explainer-click (M11): a click on a's chip (centre (70, 424.5)) opens its explainer at once, as
# the pointer's (useChipExplainer.ts: a mouse's click; a touch's tap would toggle), with no rest:
# the opening's start, 80 ms in and at rest; a second click changes nothing; the pointer then leaves
# the chip for the top bar and the explainer closes. Inputs and closing shots fall on the 16 ms
# grid: a closing explainer is gone at its exit's end, React's at that instant, the port's from its
# next frame.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 70 424
shot click-0000
wait 80
shot click-0080
wait 560
shot click-0640
click 70 424
wait 16
shot click-again
move 760 48
wait 208
shot click-gone
